  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'GENTLE HANDS. GIANT EGG.


    Drive using your normal controls. The egg
    rolls physically in the spoon: acceleration, braking, steering, bumps and impacts
    matter. HOLD ACTION to brake and trim the spoon with the same axes: forward/back
    pitches, left/right rolls. Release to drive.


    Carry your egg through all
    three marked checkpoints and across the finish. A spill/break adds 8 seconds.
    Physically return to your last secured checkpoint (or START), stop, and HOLD
    ACTION for 3 seconds to replace it. No replacement away from a station; no checkpoint/finish
    credit without an intact egg.


    TIMED ranks adjusted time; CLEAN prioritizes
    a clean finish; FEWEST prioritizes fewer lost/broken eggs. Everyone has the same
    physical constraints. The race ends after 180 seconds; stranded/capsized trucks
    may DNF. Pause/help preserve physics. Use chase view to see the spoon.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
